sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin
    participant UI as KB Settings UI
    participant API as Tenant API
    participant Jobs as Ingest Job Store
    participant Runner as Ingest Runner
    participant DB as Searchable Store
    participant User
    participant Ask as Ask/Search API
    participant AI as AI Runtime

    Admin->>UI: Save SOP or FAQ document
    UI->>API: POST document with sourceId and rawText
    API->>DB: Create or update document
    API->>Jobs: Create PENDING reindex job
    API-->>UI: Return document + jobId
    Jobs->>Runner: Claim job
    Runner->>DB: Replace searchable chunks
    Runner->>Jobs: Mark COMPLETED or FAILED
    User->>Ask: Ask maintenance question
    Ask->>DB: Retrieve filtered keyword and semantic hits
    Ask->>AI: Send grounded context only
    AI-->>Ask: JSON answer with confidence and citations
    Ask->>DB: Write metadata query log
    Ask-->>User: Return cited answer
